From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RK3128 reference <reference@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: rockchip: add an RK3128 RGA1-plus mem2mem driver

RGA1-plus has a distinct command ABI and internal MMU. Map DMA-SG image
buffers through per-context DMA page tables and use a bounded image worker,
with runtime PM and private resets.
Drain context work before close and pending mem2mem scheduler work before
freeing its device, including removal with open files.
Leave board enablement to the device tree.

Signed-off-by: RK3128 reference <reference@example.invalid>

